This package implements Open Badges 3.0 and the Comprehensive Learner Record Standard (CLR) 2.0 over the Verifiable
Credentials Data Model of W3C, and reads and verifies Open Badges 2.0. It includes no file of 1EdTech: the JSON schemas and the
specification pages that its tests read are downloaded at pinned hashes and never committed.

